<title>UK: ED &amp; F Man launches new global futures fund.</title>
<headline>ED &amp; F Man launches new global futures fund.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ED &amp; F Man Investment Products said on Wednesday it was launching its seventh global futures fund, designed mainly for German investors.</p>
<p>The Global Futures Fund VII Ltd, which matures in 2007, will invest in a diversifed portfolio of interbank currency and futures markets.</p>
<p>Minimum investment is 20,000 marks with no early redemption fee after June 1, 2003.</p>
<p>Management fees are four percent a year with a 20-percent performance fee on new net profits.</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Thatcher, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770</p>
</text>
